  intro: { uz: "LC kuni. Listening'da eng köp yöqotiladigan ball — taqqoslaş: \"çeaper than the old one, but not as çeap as…\". Ikki narsa aytiladi, javob uçinçisi.", en: 'LC day. The most commonly lost Listening marks are comparisons: "cheaper than the old one, but not as cheap as…". Two things are said; the answer is the third.' },
