      p: { uz: "Part 2: \"I watç films every weekend.\" Part 3: \"Streaming has made it far easier for people to watç films at home.\" Ikkinçi gapda 'I' yöq, artikl bor (the, a), umumiy ot bor (people). Artikl xatosi aynan şu yerda köpayadi: 'the people', 'the society' — NOTÖĞRI, umumiy maʼnoda artiklsiz.", en: 'Part 2: "I watch films every weekend." Part 3: "Streaming has made it far easier for people to watch films at home." No "I", articles in place, a general noun (people). Article errors multiply here: "the people", "the society" — WRONG in the general sense; no article.' },
